  "title": "Northern Ireland Drumcree parade banned amid tensions",
  "summary": "The Northern Ireland secretary of state, Chris Bryant, has banned the Drumcree parade after a 13-day impasse between the Orange Order and nationalists, leading to widespread protests and public order concerns.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Northern Ireland secretary of state, Chris Bryant, banned the Drumcree parade after a 13-day impasse between the Orange Order and nationalists.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The ban was announced on Friday night and is part of efforts to defuse tensions between Protestants and Catholics in the region.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The UK government condemned the action, highlighting the scale of the protest and its potential illegal nature.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
